B.RR=new A.b8(B.dS,["What are the fees for using SORA?","SORA operates on a transparent, no-brokerage model for direct transactions between buyers, sellers, and renters. While listing is generally free, premium features or specific services might have associated costs, which will always be clearly communicated."],t.l)
B.RV=new A.b8(B.dS,["How can I search for properties in a specific area?",'You can use the search bar in the navigation bar or on the home page to enter a location, or utilize the advanced search filters on the "Buy," "Rent," or "Lease" pages to narrow down your search by location, property type, price range, and more.'],t.l)
